# Does this mock/emulator actually conform to the linked doc?

No `prepare` step ran — nothing here needs a transcript lookup or a local
file resolved ahead of time. The marker names a remote URL; visit it
yourself and check the marked code against what it actually says.

## Inputs

- The doc URL this code claims to conform to:

